<div class="rounded-box bg-base-100 p-8 lg:col-span-8" role="status">
  <p class="label text-base-content/75">You're on the list</p>
  <p class="mt-3 font-heading text-[1.75rem] leading-snug font-medium">Thank you, {{ record.name }}. {% if record.seats and record.seats != 1 %}{{ record.seats }} chairs are{% else %}A chair is{% endif %} yours for {{ record.reading }}.</p>
  <p class="body-copy mt-3">{% if record.hold_book %}We'll keep a copy of the book behind the counter with your name on it. {% endif %}If your plans change, just reply to our email.</p>
</div>
